    {
      "id": "s2",
      "caption": "Compound angles: computing sin 75 degrees",
      "narration": "Sin of a sum expands: sin 75 degrees is sin of 45 plus 30. The four familiar values fly into their slots and multiply out to root 6 plus root 2 over 4 - about 0.966.",
